    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/07d88dcfa083e1bbf9d367fce6f7d5d0.avif?t=1737567445\" /></div><br>Bring your stained glass masterpiece to dazzling digital life in Sagrada, the dice-drafting board game from Floodgate Games.<br><br>Take turns selecting colorful dice and placing them in your gorgeous stained-glass window. The artisan who creates the most beautiful window wins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your dice carefully!</h2>Find the perfect fit for each piece of your window: restrictions on both the color and number showing on your die make for a puzzling challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use your tools!</h2>As a master artisan, your tools-of-the-trade will help you shape the dice available.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please your admirers!</h2>Adapt to the fickle demands of your patrons -- while keeping your signature artistic flair -- for additional prestige.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/cd1af32c7bab4b7e0d5e47b83b6930b7.avif?t=1737567445\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/07d88dcfa083e1bbf9d367fce6f7d5d0.avif?t=1737567445\" /></div><br>Bring your stained glass masterpiece to dazzling digital life in Sagrada, the dice-drafting board game from Floodgate Games.<br><br>Take turns selecting colorful dice and placing them in your gorgeous stained-glass window. The artisan who creates the most beautiful window wins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your dice carefully!</h2>Find the perfect fit for each piece of your window: restrictions on both the color and number showing on your die make for a puzzling challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use your tools!</h2>As a master artisan, your tools-of-the-trade will help you shape the dice available.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please your admirers!</h2>Adapt to the fickle demands of your patrons -- while keeping your signature artistic flair -- for additional prestige.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/cd1af32c7bab4b7e0d5e47b83b6930b7.avif?t=1737567445\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "A game of dice drafting and window crafting.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cAnother really well made digital port. Decent AI, campaign mode, leaderboards, pass-and-play, solid visuals, great controls, etc. It is a really nice package when you view it as a whole.\u201d<br>PixelatedCardboard<br><br>\u201cSometimes there's nothing like having a high quality, challenging board game on your phone.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cSagrada works fantastically well as an adaptation from the popular board game made by Floodgate Games, while delivering a fun, solid and visually stunning experience.\u201d<br>Co-Op or Solo<br>",
